# Source for src/data/walkthrough.json -- run `node tools/build-walkthrough.js`
# to regenerate it, and `node tools/verify-walkthrough.js` to replay it
# against the real game (tools/play.js) and check every step's "done"
# condition fires.
#
# One step per line:   at | cmd | why | done | opts
#   at    map.json room id the command is typed in (also used to route the
#         player back when they wander off)
#   cmd   exact command to type
#   why   short, spoiler-light hint shown in the input placeholder
#   done  alternatives separated by " || ":  arrive=ROOM  item=ID
#         placed=ID  text=PHRASE  cmd   (see src/js/walkthrough-logic.js)
#   opts  space separated:  gate  until=PHRASE  fight=PHRASE  (the last two
#         only tell tools/verify-walkthrough.js to repeat the command)
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored; "## Title" lines start
# a new chapter (used only for readability of this file).

## Around the house
WEST-OF-HOUSE | open mailbox | Start with the obvious | text=Opening the small mailbox
WEST-OF-HOUSE | north | Take a look around the house | arrive=NORTH-OF-HOUSE
NORTH-OF-HOUSE | north | A path leads into the trees | arrive=PATH
PATH | up | That big tree looks climbable | arrive=UP-A-TREE
UP-A-TREE | take egg | Something shiny up here | item=egg
UP-A-TREE | down | Back to the ground | arrive=PATH
PATH | south | Back toward the house | arrive=NORTH-OF-HOUSE
NORTH-OF-HOUSE | east | Keep circling the house | arrive=EAST-OF-HOUSE
EAST-OF-HOUSE | open window | One window is slightly ajar | text=open the window far enough
EAST-OF-HOUSE | west | Climb in | arrive=KITCHEN | gate
KITCHEN | take sack | The table has been used recently | cmd
KITCHEN | open sack | See what's inside | text=Opening the brown sack
KITCHEN | take garlic | Hold on to this for later | item=garlic
KITCHEN | drop sack | No need to carry the rest | cmd
KITCHEN | west | Head for the living room | arrive=LIVING-ROOM | gate
LIVING-ROOM | take lamp | You'll want a light | item=lamp
LIVING-ROOM | take sword | Take the sword. It might be dangerous down there. | item=sword
LIVING-ROOM | open case | The trophy case looks expectant | text=Opened. || cmd
LIVING-ROOM | put egg in case | Start your collection | placed=egg
LIVING-ROOM | turn on lamp | Better light it before going somewhere dark | text=lantern is now on
LIVING-ROOM | move rug | That rug looks out of place | text=the rug is moved to one side
LIVING-ROOM | open trap door | What was it hiding? | text=reluctantly opens to reveal
LIVING-ROOM | down | Time to explore below | arrive=CELLAR | gate
CELLAR | north | Follow the passage | arrive=TROLL-ROOM | gate
TROLL-ROOM | kill troll with sword | Something is blocking the way -- be persistent | text=troll breathes his last | until=troll breathes his last

